text:
To investigate json file structure, collect keys and values from the the first three levels of the structure and store them in json format. If a value is of string type, output first 50 chars. If an element is a list, dive in and discover the structure of the first element. The output might look like
JSON File Structure:
{
  "group_1.json": [
{
    "created": "2022-10-13T18:32:23Z",
    "group_no": 2,
    "people": [
      {
        "name": "Ivan Dorn",
        "birth_date": "2001-04-07"
      }
    ]
  }
]
}
